{"id":"d942276aed0f18b2","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-zfc-tree11-body-map-under-embedding.md","title":"ZFC Tree11 Body Map Under Embedding","display":"df-zfc-tree11-body-map-under-embedding — ZFC Tree11 Body Map Under Embedding","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-tree11-body-map-under-embedding","aliases":["58-df-zfc-tree11-body-map-under-embedding"],"display":"df-zfc-tree11-body-map-under-embedding — ZFC Tree11 Body Map Under Embedding","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-tree10-tree-embedding.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-tree11-body-of-tree.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-setop-union-family.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-tree11-body-map-under-embedding"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-tree11-body-map-under-embedding</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-tree11-body-map-under-embedding — ZFC Tree11 Body Map Under Embedding"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"31795d01e0ea2e91\" href=\"?note=31795d01e0ea2e91\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-zfc-tree10-tree-embedding.md\">../batch04/58-df-zfc-tree10-tree-embedding.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a71444a10218d32c\" href=\"?note=a71444a10218d32c\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-zfc-tree11-body-of-tree.md\">../batch11/58-df-zfc-tree11-body-of-tree.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"481582931ea56519\" href=\"?note=481582931ea56519\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-zfc-setop-union-family.md\">../batch09/58-df-zfc-setop-union-family.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\widehat f,f,T,A,U,B\\in V\">\\(\\widehat f,f,T,A,U,B\\in V\\)</span>, where <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq A^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(T\\subseteq A^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\subseteq B^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(U\\subseteq B^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree10TreeEmbedding}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree10TreeEmbedding}_S\\)</span> is the tree-embedding predicate (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"31795d01e0ea2e91\" href=\"?note=31795d01e0ea2e91\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-zfc-tree10-tree-embedding.md\">../batch04/58-df-zfc-tree10-tree-embedding.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree11BodyOfTree}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree11BodyOfTree}_S\\)</span> is the body predicate (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"a71444a10218d32c\" href=\"?note=a71444a10218d32c\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-zfc-tree11-body-of-tree.md\">../batch11/58-df-zfc-tree11-body-of-tree.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> and restriction are as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>; family union and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span> are as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"481582931ea56519\" href=\"?note=481582931ea56519\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-zfc-setop-union-family.md\">../batch09/58-df-zfc-setop-union-family.md</a> and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTree11BodyMapUnderEmbedding}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTree11BodyMapUnderEmbedding}_S:V^6\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree11\\text{-}body\\text{-}map\\text{-}under\\text{-}embedding}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree11BodyMapUnderEmbedding}_S(\\widehat f,f,T,A,U,B)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists P_T,P_U\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree11BodyOfTree}_S(P_T,T,A)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTree11BodyOfTree}_S(P_U,U,B)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTree10TreeEmbedding}_S(f,T,\\{\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in T\\times T:a\\subseteq b\\},U,\\{\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in U\\times U:a\\subseteq b\\})\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\widehat f,P_T,P_U)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall b\\in P_T\\;\\left(\n\\widehat f(b)=\\bigcup\\{f(b{\\upharpoonright}n):n\\in\\omega\\}\n\\right)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree11\\text{-}body\\text{-}map\\text{-}under\\text{-}embedding}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree11BodyMapUnderEmbedding}_S(\\widehat f,f,T,A,U,B)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists P_T,P_U\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcTree11BodyOfTree}_S(P_T,T,A)\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTree11BodyOfTree}_S(P_U,U,B)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTree10TreeEmbedding}_S(f,T,\\{\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in T\\times T:a\\subseteq b\\},U,\\{\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in U\\times U:a\\subseteq b\\})\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\widehat f,P_T,P_U)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall b\\in P_T\\;\\left(\n\\widehat f(b)=\\bigcup\\{f(b{\\upharpoonright}n):n\\in\\omega\\}\n\\right)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Both alphabets and both tree bodies are explicit; the induced branch map is a typed function whose value is the union of the embedded initial segments.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-zfc-tree10-tree-embedding.md","status":"resolved","id":"31795d01e0ea2e91","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-zfc-tree10-tree-embedding.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-zfc-tree11-body-of-tree.md","status":"resolved","id":"a71444a10218d32c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-tree11-body-of-tree.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-zfc-setop-union-family.md","status":"resolved","id":"481582931ea56519","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-zfc-setop-union-family.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-omega.md","status":"resolved","id":"5045d216c83e75cb","anchor":"ref-6","ta